Dialogue: 2,0:01:45.98,0:01:48.98,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(513,0)\pos(956,705)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\blur0.8}Ruins of the Muggy Kingdom\NGloom Island
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.49,0:01:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:52.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but not long ago, Zoro found himself trapped\Non a certain gloomy island with Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.03,0:01:58.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The heck is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like a grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The question's who made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.41,0:02:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever they are, they've got some skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.53,0:02:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was carved straight out of that tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.67,0:02:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if this is\Ngood creepy or bad creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.67,0:02:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.79,0:02:40.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.03,0:02:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strong too!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.63,0:02:44.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.03,0:03:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those things?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.67,0:03:20.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)\pos(956,745)\fnRoboto Bold\bord2.2\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(880,980,\1a&H00&)}The Land of Poverty, Hungeria\NLazy Bones Island
Dialogue: 2,0:03:15.67,0:03:20.50,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)\pos(956,745)\fnRoboto Bold\bord0\blur0.8}The Land of Poverty, Hungeria\NLazy Bones Island
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:19.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Lazy Bones Island in\Nthe land of poverty, Hungary.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.87,0:03:24.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sent here by Kuma, Brook was mistaken\Nfor Satan by the island's inhabitants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How lovely, another perfect day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.99,0:04:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in trouble this\Ntime, do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:02.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put her down, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.73,0:04:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm going to warn you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let my daughter go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.69,0:04:08.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've had enough of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.37,0:04:10.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll give you a taste of hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.77,0:04:19.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them take me away!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.69,0:04:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, they're really\Nkidnapping her, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.31,0:04:24.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.61,0:04:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless you cursed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.31,0:04:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, now's the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never mind that!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be chasing them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.11,0:04:33.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm saving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.19,0:04:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.91,0:04:41.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear us, Satan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were cheering extra hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can save us now, Dark Lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.55,0:04:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.29,0:04:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see what got them in this\Nsituation now. They're lazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.53,0:04:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that young lady is still a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.99,0:05:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't allow her to\Nsuffer such a cruel fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.11,0:05:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.67,0:05:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the very least, I owe you for the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.93,0:05:07.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to mention the panties.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.31,0:05:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lord Satan!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must forgive me, Luffy. Everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.47,0:05:29.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right now, I'm rather busy being\NSatan in a sea of underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.41,0:05:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid our reunion will have to wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I owe my odd new friends\Na debt of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.93,0:05:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am confident that I\Nshall resolve this quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.75,0:05:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you keep safe until then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.65,0:05:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep in the south blue\Nlies Birdie Kingdom,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(954,0)\pos(956,720)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(754,954,\1a&H00&)}Birdie Kingdom\NSouth Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:05:53.12,0:05:57.13,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(954,0)\pos(956,720)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\blur0.8}Birdie Kingdom\NSouth Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.87,0:05:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where a race of giant\Nbirds reigns supreme.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.47,0:06:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I really want\Noff this stinking island.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.73,0:06:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is seriously the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:18.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birds treating me like I'm their toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.31,0:06:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And humans constantly trying\Nto eat me in a hot pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.97,0:06:29.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's not bad\Nenough, and it really is,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.87,0:06:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the birds and humans won't\Nstop fighting each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.25,0:06:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's got to be a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.19,0:06:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Positioned deep in the Grand\NLine, we find Peachy Island,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.69,0:06:59.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)\pos(956,720)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(813,980,\1a&H00&)}Kamabakka Queendom\NPeachy Island, Grand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:06:55.69,0:06:59.46,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,0)\pos(956,720)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\blur0.8}Kamabakka Queendom\NPeachy Island, Grand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.03,0:06:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home of the Kamabakka Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.29,0:07:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.53,0:07:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't even looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:06.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Am I safe in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.81,0:07:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with you psychos?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.93,0:07:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow, I've been waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.15,0:07:40.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.63,0:07:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh-ho-ho-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dear Nami and Robin, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope this finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.21,0:08:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do so look forward to\Nseeing the two of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.05,0:08:07.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm certain that when the time comes,\NWe'll be better friends than ever before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.85,0:08:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far away but not long ago, On a\Nsky island known as Weatheria,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.49,0:08:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A weather wizard Or rather a weathered\Nscientist Continued his studies.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,0)\pos(1001,780)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx125\fscy125\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(452,486,\1a&H00&)}Weatheria
Dialogue: 2,0:08:35.95,0:08:38.96,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,0)\pos(1001,780)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx125\fscy125\bord0\blur1}Weatheria
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.55,0:08:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young lady, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.85,0:08:44.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.05,0:08:49.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the heck?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.51,0:08:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It flies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.75,0:08:52.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.09,0:08:55.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.83,0:09:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.27,0:09:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the island I was looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's land there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.83,0:09:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.71,0:09:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can save our island, and\Nwe're to believe that? Huh? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:31.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.36,0:09:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, I'm an\Nexpert with the weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll gladly summon a\Nshower or two. You jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.85,0:09:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how about we make a little deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.71,0:09:44.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does 100 million berries sound fair?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.57,0:09:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.55,0:09:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I highball it a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.97,0:09:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do they look rich to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.89,0:09:57.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.45,0:10:00.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how does a hundred sound? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.65,0:10:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sound cheap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.81,0:10:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.81,0:10:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soap bubbles, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.27,0:10:18.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like there's something inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.95,0:10:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.45,0:10:24.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you take this and generate\Nsome wind for me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:27.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.73,0:10:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want it full power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.81,0:11:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.97,0:11:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rain clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.41,0:11:03.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.65,0:11:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's raining!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.73,0:11:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.85,0:11:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They sure are happy, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.41,0:11:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A science of weather has\Nmany wonderful applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.33,0:12:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Mechanical\NIsland, Futureland, Baltimore?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,also known as the\Nbirthplace of the genius.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:05.86,0:12:09.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,0)\pos(956,710)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(452,486,\1a&H00&)}Mech Island\NFutureland Baldimore
Dialogue: 2,0:12:05.86,0:12:09.27,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,0)\pos(956,710)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\blur0.8}Mech Island\NFutureland Baldimore
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.95,0:12:14.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get him to the hospital, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnAbscissa\alpha&HFF&\c&HFFE7FD&\3c&H13011F&\blur0.3\fax-0.389\fscx65.55\fscy76.17\frz18.18\frx-0.458\fry-3.092\xbord0.7\ybord0.6\org(1076,494)\b700\pos(1090.099,537.53)}....{\alpha&H00&}Surgery in\NProgress
Dialogue: 2,0:12:36.26,0:12:38.19,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnAbscissa\alpha&HFF&\c&HFFE7FD&\blur0.8\fax-0.389\fscx65.55\fscy76.17\frz18.18\frx-0.458\fry-3.092\xbord0\ybord0\org(1076,494)\b700\pos(1090.099,537.53)}....{\alpha&H00&}Surgery in\NProgress
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.21,0:12:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, he's definitely a cyborg.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he runs on cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.51,0:12:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.81,0:12:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any sodas to refuel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.05,0:12:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.57,0:12:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to begin. Right.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.11,0:12:57.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnAbscissa\alpha&HFF&\c&HFFE7FD&\3c&H13011F&\blur0.3\t(218,652,\c&H534990&\3c&H060716&)\fax-0.38\fscx65.2\fscy73.92\frz18.198\frx-0.459\fry-3.093\xbord0.7\ybord0.6\org(1075,493)\b700\move(1088.326,534.78,1087.53,534.58,218,652)}....{\alpha&H00&}Surgery in\NProgress
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.11,0:12:57.11,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnAbscissa\alpha&HFF&\c&HFFE7FD&\blur0.8\t(218,652,\c&H7167A3&)\fax-0.38\fscx65.2\fscy73.92\frz18.198\frx-0.459\fry-3.093\xbord0\ybord0\org(1075,493)\b700\move(1088.326,534.78,1087.53,534.58,218,652)}....{\alpha&H00&}Surgery in\NProgress
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:20.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, you're the young\Nlad from earlier, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do hope I haven't kept\Nyou waiting for too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.45,0:13:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're definitely different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.31,0:13:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did they do to you? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.57,0:13:31.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it seems the cola is hard to come by here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.01,0:13:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they brewed up some\Nfine hot tea instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.93,0:13:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge healing, to be precise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hot tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.95,0:13:44.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The aroma and flavor are truly super.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.55,0:13:52.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really nothing quite so relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.57,0:13:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if you say so, I'm\Nsorry. Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.65,0:14:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enjoy careful it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.49,0:14:16.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No no this is weird it's all wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.31,0:14:19.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey mister you're not funny now I\Nliked you more the way you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.75,0:14:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.81,0:14:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.41,0:14:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How on earth did I end up\Nout here in the elements?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.30,0:14:56.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, how lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A scarf for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.30,0:14:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.93,0:15:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness, this, this is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:15.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.75,0:15:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an enclosed forest\Nof mechanical animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.87,0:15:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ready for plan A's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.73,0:15:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surprise awakening in the\Njungle nothing's more wild than
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.93,0:15:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,mecca animals this will get\Nhim back on track for sure now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now let's calm down shall\Nwe friends because you seem
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.33,0:16:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,agitated this morning did you\Nremember to eat your breakfast it
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is the most important meal of\Nthe day you know let's work
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.59,0:16:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on getting those blood sugar\Nlevels up hold on a second that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Means it's breakfast time\Nfor me too, you silly goose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.11,0:16:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,delicious
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.59,0:16:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.51,0:16:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,better way to start
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.47,0:16:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the day than with a cup of tea
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.89,0:16:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let's cherish every moment\Nfriends it's not working?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.71,0:17:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone help us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.23,0:17:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mama, violence is never the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.35,0:17:23.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're at an age\Nwhere you want to be not.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.07,0:17:30.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But listen, we can sort\Nthis out like gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:35.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good ever comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awful violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just fight back, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't reason with gorillas.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.97,0:17:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.80,0:17:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to words.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.97,0:17:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to what I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.09,0:17:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you'd let me talk, I\Nhave wisdom to impart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.13,0:17:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My friend, we must...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.79,0:18:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.29,0:18:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.37,0:18:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think I am,\Nyou punks? Chopped liver?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.65,0:18:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't step to Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.91,0:18:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are seriously starting\Nto scare me! Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.73,0:18:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.15,0:18:47.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cooled off a bit and ran\Nout of steam. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.14,0:18:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean, you're gonna turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.13,0:18:53.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know just the place to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.33,0:19:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My grandpa told me there's\Nsome dangerous stuff in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.27,0:19:10.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's an emergency and I have you\Nto protect me, so it should be okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.47,0:19:29.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1016)\pos(956,745)\fnRoboto Bold\bord2.2\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(846,980,\1a&H00&)\t(4984,5151,\1a&HFF&)}Tequila Wolf\NEast Blue
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.47,0:19:29.47,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(980,1016)\pos(956,745)\fnRoboto Bold\bord0\blur0.8}Tequila Wolf\NEast Blue
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.59,0:19:32.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's your breakfast, lunch, and dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.79,0:19:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you finish that, we'll\Nget back to our questioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:36.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to intrude, but it sounds like\Nyou've been hurt pretty bad, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.07,0:19:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a decrepit old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.69,0:19:53.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only been in this\Ncountry for a single day now,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the guards in charge\Nsaid the elderly are useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they promptly threw me in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.13,0:19:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.75,0:20:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.99,0:20:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a band of dissidents running wild!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.23,0:20:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The warden called for backup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.13,0:20:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ordered all of us to get over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.75,0:20:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.95,0:20:22.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A band of dissidents? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we were quick to\Nfollow your orders, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.65,0:20:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All teams descended on the group\Nso it didn't get out of hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:30.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.95,0:20:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't give any orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.91,0:20:38.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you say all teams, Do you mean the\Nsoldiers stationed at the prison tower?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.31,0:20:46.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an agent working for\Nthe Revolutionary Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.19,0:20:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.55,0:20:51.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think I give a\Ndamn about the dissonance?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:53.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take down Mock Robin on site, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.85,0:20:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.93,0:20:59.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your command of our\Nforces, I know we can win.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:01.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you can count on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.17,0:21:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Release the young lady from her cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.95,0:21:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, she's already been\Nthrough enough as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.91,0:21:19.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And clutch!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.05,0:21:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Nico Robin?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:40.50,0:21:43.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,0)\pos(956,700)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord2.5\1a&HFF&\blur0.8\t(453,486,\1a&H00&)}Bowin Archipelago\NGrand Line
Dialogue: 2,0:21:40.50,0:21:43.41,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(486,0)\pos(956,700)\fnRoboto Bold\fscx110\fscy110\bord0\blur0.8}Bowin Archipelago\NGrand Line
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.81,0:21:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It smells so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.25,0:21:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, and he bumps when\Nyou got stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.57,0:21:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ramen falls in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spaghetti patches in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.09,0:21:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ham fruits in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.13,0:22:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chocolate rocks in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:03.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.19,0:22:04.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all safe to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.69,0:22:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:08.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'm okay to eat this too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.23,0:22:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Yum-yum. Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.95,0:22:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you've had enough\Nto build up your stamina,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.11,0:22:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the man-eating plan's in one\Nmess with you. Sure, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:23.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This stuff is so good, I feel\Nlike I could eat forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.69,0:22:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eating's only the first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've gotta exercise, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.21,0:22:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.65,0:22:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm still on the first step here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.19,0:22:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta bulk up so I can become a cool\Nhero of the forest like you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.49,0:22:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I can't eat another bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.31,0:22:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, sopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.95,0:22:49.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you realize fat things are the first\Ncreatures to be eaten on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you talking about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.81,0:22:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's impossible to escape\Nfrom the Alabasta Islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.53,0:22:57.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me that before?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.41,0:23:01.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for me, I'm the hero\Nof the first round!

